base('finite-distribution','Finite sums can be distributed and reordered',['Work over a field; all sums here are finite.'],'ΣᵢΣⱼ aᵢⱼ=ΣⱼΣᵢ aᵢⱼ, and cΣᵢaᵢ=Σᵢcaᵢ.','Associativity, commutativity of addition, and distributivity justify these finite identities by induction on the number of summands. No claim about infinite-series reordering is being used.','Algebraic rules boundary')
