add('composition-regroup','Identify the matrix of a composition',['A is m×k, B is k×n, and x has n components.'],'A(Bx)=Cx where Cᵢⱼ=ΣₗAᵢₗBₗⱼ.','Reorder the finite double sum to group each coefficient of xⱼ: Σⱼ(ΣₗAᵢₗBₗⱼ)xⱼ. By the matrix-action definition this is Cx. This explains the multiplication formula; it says nothing about optimal algorithmic complexity.',['composition-expand','finite-distribution','matrix-def'])
