add('transport-solution','Recover the transport solution',['u is a C¹ solution of u_t+c u_x=0 with u(0,x)=u₀(x).','Characteristic segments lie in the solution domain.'],'u(t,x)=u₀(x−ct).','The previous step makes u constant along each characteristic, so u(t,x₀+ct)=u₀(x₀). Set x₀=x−ct. Conversely, for C¹ u₀, differentiating u₀(x−ct) checks the PDE and initial value. This handles constant-speed transport, not the full nonlinear coupled system.',['transport-curve','zero-derivative'])
