base('matrix-frontier','Research boundary: improved multiplication exponent',['Use the exact algorithmic model and constructions of the manuscript.'],'An improved exponent needs a valid construction and a justified complexity bound.','The coordinate identity proves what multiplication computes. It does not construct a faster algorithm. Tensor decompositions, their validity over the specified field, and their asymptotic analysis remain unexpanded research work.','Research premise boundary')
