base('limit-rules','Arithmetic of limits and differentiability',['All named limits exist as finite real numbers.'],'Limits preserve finite sums and products; differentiability implies continuity.','These real-analysis results are accepted at this boundary. They follow from epsilon-delta estimates. Their hypotheses exclude expressions such as an undefined infinity times zero.','Standard theorem boundary')
